:R-HSA-9750126  a           owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0008150 ;
        rdfs:comment        "This pathway describes how drugs commonly used in the treatment of cancer, psoriasis and severe atopic dermatitis produce DNA interstrand crosslinks that are repaired through the Fanconi anemia pathway. For review, please refer to Deans and West 2011, Fu et al. 2012, and Rycenga and Long 2018." ;
        rdfs:label          "Drug-induced formation of DNA interstrand crosslinks" ;
        dc:contributor      "Authored: Orlic-Milacic, Marija, 2021-02-01" , "Edited: Orlic-Milacic, Marija, 2021-08-09" , "Reviewed: Kadambat Nair, Sisira, 2021-07-28" , "GOC:reactome_curators" ;
